* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF，cmd.exe 对纯 LF 解析不可靠
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# 文档类不计入主要语言统计
docs/** linguist-documentation
skills/** linguist-documentation
reports/** linguist-documentation
tests/test_cases.md linguist-documentation
